{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.HookProductMonoidBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.HookProductMonoidBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaBetaProdMonoid","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.ColLenRowLensBridge","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.HookLengthFormula","lean:module:QOU.QBeta.WenzlWeightVanishing"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooksF_rowLens_wenzl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooksF_rowLens_wenzl","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/HookProductMonoidBridge.lean#L110-L115","doc":"**The bridge in the form `schurPrincipal` needs it**: its own hook product, over the cells of a\n`YoungDiagram`, is the List-encoded `prodHooksF` that the β-number machinery is proved for. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.wenzlHook_eq_hookLength","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.wenzlHook_eq_hookLength","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/HookProductMonoidBridge.lean#L104-L108","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooksF_rowLens_one_sub_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooksF_rowLens_one_sub_pow","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/HookProductMonoidBridge.lean#L92-L95","doc":"The q-instance of the bridge. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooksF_rowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooksF_rowLens","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/HookProductMonoidBridge.lean#L69-L90","doc":"**The list↔diagram hook bridge, in any commutative monoid.**\n\n`∏_{c ∈ μ.cells} f(h_μ(c)) = prodHooksF f μ.rowLens`.\n\nAt `f = id` over `(ℕ, ×)` this is `hookLengthProduct_eq_prodHooks`; at `f n = 1 − Qⁿ` it carries the\nq-analogue of the hook product from the `YoungDiagram` side, where `schurPrincipal` lives, to the\nList side, where the β-number machinery is proved. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.row_prodF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.row_prodF","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/HookProductMonoidBridge.lean#L56-L67","doc":"Product over a row = product over its column range, valued in any commutative monoid. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.rows_disjoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.rows_disjoint","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/HookProductMonoidBridge.lean#L48-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.cells_biUnion'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.cells_biUnion'","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/HookProductMonoidBridge.lean#L37-L46","doc":"Cells partition into rows `{0, …, colLen 0 − 1}`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}